+**AC-A7 (PRD AC-2) — persistent storage requested; token in IndexedDB.**
+The deliberately exempt, device-verified slice. The plan states explicitly,
+twice (Task 2's ACTION and the Notes section), that no test may assert
+merely that `navigator.storage.persist()` was called — a trivial assertion
+over a mock with no discriminative content that `test-reviewer` would
